{"id":86839,"imdb":"tt0110155","en":"The Terrorist","orig":"الإرهابي","ar":"الإرهابي","tag":null,"ov":"علي عبدالظاهر عضو في جماعة إرهابية متطرفة، ينفذ عملية إرهابية كبرى يروح ضحيتها عدد كبير من السياح، وأثناء هروبه تصدمه فتاة ثرية جميلة بسيارتها وتحمله إلى بيتها لعلاجه، وهناك يتعرف على أسرتها المتحررة، وخلال إقامته معهم، تتصارع الافكار داخله بين ما تروجه الجماعة وما يلمسه من خير وطيبة فيهم، ويشكك في كل شيء آمن به.","rd":"1994-03-13","rt":142,"g":[18],"lang":"ar","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[],"countries":["EG"],"langs":["Arabic"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"EG","d":"1994-03-13"}],"dir":["Nader Galal"],"prod":[],"wri":["Lenin EL Ramly"],"mus":["Omar Khairat"],"dop":["Samir Farag"],"cast":[{"n":"Adel Emam","ch":"Ali Abdel-Zaher / Mustafa Abdel-Rahman","p":"/vPEubkxYDRfkSUDoAfJUWQgg4cD.jpg"},{"n":"Sherine","ch":"Sawsan Abdel Moneim","p":"/cWrLR7cg9ldnoGo0pDtPfD0em59.jpg"},{"n":"Mohamed El Dafrawi","ch":"Writer Fouad Masoud","p":"/4CGr65FeV7mSZEytzZ8uKYf4TX6.jpg"},{"n":"Mustafa Metwalli","ch":"Hany","p":"/7iQYlR5QUonQv57WTnNlTlya9cw.jpg"},{"n":"Ahmad Rateb","ch":"Brother Saif","p":"/nJr6S2q3hdXZlffPRNp9Mldl34U.jpg"},{"n":"Said Tarabeek","ch":"Shaalan","p":"/4oFrjTGPqio4pOxmEDD1RBYLfwV.jpg"},{"n":"Madiha Yousri","ch":"Soraya - mother","p":"/uddi9WvjFlv9j5dVo28CO4KVbS2.jpg"},{"n":"Magda Zaki","ch":"Magda (Hani's wife)","p":"/mI35mV2LnjB6ps5E6ZpEgpHQNmk.jpg"},{"n":"Salah Zulfikar","ch":"Dr. Abdel Moneim","p":"/kn8pSGnHMfDGgNgYAuF7IV9K9cd.jpg"},{"n":"Ibrahim Yousri","ch":"Mohsen Abdel Moneim","p":"/axZcOAXXNfHkOBGqi0J916bWtDn.jpg"},{"n":"Hanan Shawqi","ch":"Faten Abdel Moneim","p":"/wh012HByEPAXUNQnB65oFQfyovJ.jpg"},{"n":"Othman Abdel Monem","ch":"Dr. Mustafa Abdel Rahman","p":"/gxdNJyLLiLEGcGX2U2dXO7JczSz.jpg"},{"n":"Mohamed Abu Dawood","ch":"Nader","p":"/x4DDTfsclsgHdGUA39a3OniHLxr.jpg"},{"n":"Mohamed Eltohamy","ch":"Sameh","p":null},{"n":"Diaa Abdel Khaleq","ch":"","p":"/u9fJZgzoGujVj28YO9RqG5na7ju.jpg"},{"n":"Abdulraheem Hassan","ch":"","p":null}]}